    "title": "Bergeron named Police Chief of the Year by Crime Fighters of Louisiana - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Press Release ,\n11 hours ago The Hammond Police Department is proud to announce that Chief Edwin Bergeron, Jr., has been honored as Police Chief of the Year by Crime Fighters of Louisiana. This prestigious recognition highlights Chief Bergeron’s unwavering commitment to public safety, his leadership within the department, and his dedication to protecting the citizens of Hammond while supporting victims of crime. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
